{1 = 1-12}
9=1.	@wRN{Rīm-@wDN{Sîn}}, king with princely divine powers, leader with all the divine powers, raising high your princely head! 
13=2.	The @fsux{abzu} is the august holy shrine of the @wTN{E-kiš-nu-ŋal}, 
17=3.	a great vastness in depth and breadth, the foundation of the innermost holy pure buildings, 
21=4.	with a pleasant odour like a forest of aromatic cedars and @fsux{ḫašḫur} trees. 
25=5.	It forms the foundations (?) of the temple, within the temple, 
29=6.	a protection for the temple; the terrifying splendour of the temple, 
33=7.	a great corner, 
37=8.	a holy corner within the solid interior. 
41=9.	The design of the doorway is a magic bond: 
45=10.	a solar disc at whose top is a standard representing a rapacious eagle, 
49=11.	violently seizing stags which turn to the left and right. 
53=12.	Gods stand guard over the doorway. 

{13 = 13-27}
57=13.	In this place, you see numerous tall birch trees. The door frame, 
61=14.	the architrave, the lock, the fence (?) around the threshold, the door-leaves, 
65=15.	the bolt, the bar of the temple, the supporting wall of the temple terrace, 
69=16.	foundation of the innermost holy pure buildings -- all these are of very holy reeds, golden yellow or silver white. 
