{28 = 28-38}
117=28.	Within the temple is the gateway of the great august sanctuary: 
121=29.	endowed with abundant charms like a fine woman whose head is nobly raised high, 
125=30.	whose attraction radiates as if with the maturity of fruit, with abundant charms, 
129=31.	lovable, but imposing in splendour like the hills. In the midst, 
133=32.	at the sides and in the four corners are august protective goddesses, foundations (?) of the statues. 
137=33.	Taking turns of office on the day of the new moon, 
141=34.	the protective god and the protective goddess of the temple, the serving deities, 
145=35.	inhabitants of the temple, 
149=36.	as guardians of the outer gateway and of the god's pedestal, 
153=37.	can be seen sweeping the ground of the building from the base of the enclosure wall, 
157=38.	in accordance with the sublime purification rites of the temple. 

{39 = 39-46}
161=39.	Its …… is an august protective goddess who indeed brings butter, 
165=40.	cheese and loaves for you. May the serving deities, 
169=41.	the protective goddesses, the good mother goddesses, 
173=42.	receive favourable offerings (?) from you for their attention to the temple, 
177=43.	so that when you light the wood of the heaped high censers, 
